   "g": "C",
   "checked": true,
   "pub": "2012-04-22 (originally posted 2011)"
  },
  {
   "text": "Afropop says this track and 'Dying in Your Arms' pull in bits of the past (a chipmunked house sample, a cheesy synth tone) and show the crew's melodic gifts.",
